menu "PluTO encoders"

    comment "Compiled in: changing anything here means reflashing."

    config PLUTO_ENCODERS
        bool "Read the servo angles from AS5600 encoders"
        default n
        help
            Reads each axis from an AS5600 on an I2C bus of its own and
            reports the measured position and the tracking error in the state
            (meas and err_cdeg, device-state.md). Off, both go out as null and
            nothing touches the I2C pins (fixed in main.c: pan on 21/22, tilt
            on 32/33). Off until the encoders are mounted: the chip is not
            confirmed yet.

endmenu
